### Step 2: Conflict Analysis

```markdown
# Conflict Analysis Template

## Existing Rules Analysis

- [ ] Check all rules in same category
- [ ] Review rules with same scope
- [ ] Analyze rules for same audience
- [ ] Identify rules with same tooling

## Potential Conflicts

- [ ] **Scope conflicts**: Rules targeting same files/patterns
- [ ] **Enforcement conflicts**: Contradictory lint/ci settings
- [ ] **Content conflicts**: Overlapping instructions
- [ ] **Tooling conflicts**: Different tools for same purpose

## Resolution Plan

- [ ] **Merge**: Combine complementary rules
- [ ] **Specialize**: Make rules context-specific
- [ ] **Deprecate**: Mark old rules as superseded
- [ ] **Split**: Divide broad rules into focused ones
```

